+      - LENDINGCROWD
+      - ARCHOVER
+      - THINCATS
+      - SHAWBROOK
+      - CLOSE BROTHERS
+      - ALDERMORE
+      - STRIPE CAPITAL
+      - PAYPAL WORKING CAPITAL
+      - PAYPAL BUSINESS LOAN
+      - SHOPIFY CAPITAL
+      - AMAZON LENDING
+      - SQUARE CAPITAL
+      - SQUARE LOANS
+      - SUMUP CASH ADVANCE
+      - MERCHANT CASH ADVANCE
+      - BUSINESS CASH ADVANCE
+      - BOUNCE BACK LOAN
+      - BBLS
+      - CBILS
